bījākṣaramaṃtrasahita
śivanirvāṇa

oṃśrīgaṇeśāyanamaḥ|| [athanirvāṇapaddhatiḥ] || śuddhasthānemṛdbhasmagoma
yāmbhobhibhūmiṃvilepayet tatrasambhārānānaye|| pramayasamayeyeṣāṃ
nāyaṃsamutkramaṇevidhiḥghaṭitititānpratyantyeṣṭiṃbravīmiśivoditām
bhavatikṛtayāśaivīdīkṣāyayācamalakṣayādapisamayināmācāryādi
kramādadhikāriṇām sarveṣāmadharasthānāṃgurvantānāmapisphuṭam śa
śaktipātapraretānāṃkuryādantyeṣṭidīkṣiṇām|| jīyānmātrīmahājvā
lāśivāśupadadāyinī yatsphuliṅgāgnisaṃsparśādduritaṃyātibhasma
sāt|| tatrādāvaghorāstreṇa bhūmiśodhanam|| oṃhrīṃhūṃprasphura (2) ghora
ghorataratanurūpa caṭa (2) pracaṭa (2) kaha (2) vama (2) ghātaya (2) hūṃ (3) hraḥphaṭ (3)
aghorāstrāyanamaḥ|

<pṛ0 1a> anenaastraśodhanaṃvidhāya vīrāsanesamupaviśya ātmāsanāyanamaḥ ādhā
raśaktyainamaḥ kamalāsanāyanamaḥ ityāsanaṃsampūjya tataḥsindūreṇaśā
licūrṇenavāpadmatrayamullikhya padmatrayeāsanapakṣaṃsampūjyayathā ādhā
raśaktyainamaḥ pṛthivyainamaḥ kṣīrārṇavāyanamaḥ bījāṅkurāyanamaḥ unmanāya
namaḥ padmāsanāyanamaḥ pretāsanāyanamaḥ praṇavāsanāyanamaḥ ityā
sanapakṣaṃsampūjya| tatrapūjitāsanedvaitadvaitadṛśāgandhāmbhasāpūritaṃka
laśatrayaṃpūjayet teṣuphalādikaṃnikṣipya pūjāṃkuryāt tatrādausvada
kṣeastrārghapātraṃpūjayet oṃgaḥastrāyaphaṭ kaḥastrāyaphaṭ raḥa
strāyaphaṭ yaastrāyaphaṭ tena oṃhūṃphaṭ sarvadravyopacāraśuddhirastuphaṭ

<pṛ0 1ba> punaḥsvaiḥsvaiḥmantrai oṃādhūmra (2) jīva (2) saḥsaḥsarvāsāṃpuṣpajātīnāṃjī
vāgacchatusvāhā puṣpe kālāgnirudrarūpāyajagaddhūpasugandhine sarvaga
ndhavahāyanamaḥ dhūpe jagajjyotīrūpāyanamaḥ dīpe gandhamādinegandhaṃjīvā
payatusvāhā candane oṃhrīṃsaḥkuṅkume oṃlāṃpṛthivyairdharitraśaktyainamaḥ a
rghye blīṃvaruṇarājānakāyanamaḥ udake yāṃrāṃlāṃvāṃsarvottamadravyebhyonamaḥ
sarvadravyeṣu itidravyaśuddhiḥ|| oṃhūṃ akṣitādinādigbandhanaṃkarominamaḥ
itidigbandhanamantraḥ tato apasarpantutebhūtā madhyāṅguṣṭayogenanārācamu
drayāpuṣpaprayogānantaraṃkoṭikābhistālāhati pārṣṇighātatrayena divyā
ntarikṣakṣobhānvighnānnivārya koṭikābhirdaśadigbandhanaṃkuryāt triśūla

<pṛ0 2a> mudrāṃpradarśya prāṇāyāmaṃkuryāt oṃpūrakaṃ (12) kumbhakaṃ (24) recakaṃ (36) iti
mantreṇa laṃrecakaṃkarominamaḥ (12) itiśuddhaṃprāṇavāyuṃdvādaśapraṇavoścāra
kālaṃ yāvaddakṣiṇanāsāpuṭena vahiḥkṣipet vaṃpūrakaṃkarominamaḥ (24)
śuddhaṃśvetaṃprāṇavāyuṃcaturviṃśatpraṇavoścārakālaṃyāvadantarvāmanāsāpuṭe
napraveśayet raṃkumbhakaṃkarominamaḥ (36) tamevaprāṇavāyuṃjalabhṛtaku
mbhavadacalasthityāṣaṭtriṃśatpraṇavoścārakālaṃyāvadantarnirodhayet yaṃū
rdhvarecakaṃkarominamaḥ ititamevakumbhitaṃhṛtkaṇṭhatālubhrūmadhyabrahmarandhrabhedana
krameṇanovāśakyatvāśanaiḥśanairvāmanāsāpuṭenabahiḥkṣipet ityūrdhvarecakaḥ
oṃhaṃvyomātmānaṃsthāpayāminamaḥ hṛtpadmasthitātmānaṃsūkṣmaṃkhadyotanibhaṃ sphurattāra

<pṛ0 2ba> kākāraṃhṛtkaṇṭhatālubhrumadhyabrahmarandhrabhedanakrameṇadvādaśānteviniyojya manoha
ṅkārabuddhīvilopyaparatatvevilāpyaśūnyaṃśarīraṃdhyātvā sūkṣmaśarīraśuddhiḥ|| athasthū
ladehaśuddhiṃśoṣaṇādidhāraṇābhiḥkuryāt kṣyūṃ imāṃtanuṃśoṣayāminamaḥ itisva
śarīraṃśuṣkatarurūpaṃcintayet itipārthivī rkṣyūṃ imāṃtanuṃdāhayāminamaḥ itida
kṣiṇapādāṅguṣṭhātkālāgnimutthitaṃdhyātvā tajjvālābhiḥ sabāhyābhyantaraṃśarīraṃbhasmībhūtaṃbhā
vayet ityāgnīye|| ylūṃtanorutplāvanaṃkarominamaḥ itiśārīraṃbhasmavāyunādaśa
diggataṃbhāvayet itivāyavī|| vaṃtanumaplāvayāminamaḥ itidvādaśāntapatita
cidbindusrutāmṛtadhārābhistatsthānaṃkṣālitaṃbhāvayet itivāruṇī viṣasyevamā
rakatvaṃmantraśaktyānivāryate nasvarūpaṃdehāhaṃbhāvasyavilāpanaṃnasvarūpanāśaḥ iti
bhāvaḥ|

<pṛ0 3a> evaṃṣāṭkośakeśarīrenivṛtteparamānandamayamātmānaṃbhāvayet oṃhaṃsaṃ
vinmayosmi nāhamasminacānyostidhyeyaṃcātranavidyate ānandapadasaṃlīnaṃ
manaḥsamarasīgatam ityākāśī tataḥkandātprabhṛtihṛdantamāsanapakṣaṃ
nyaset oṃādhāraśaktyainamaḥ kṣīrodārṇavāyanamaḥ candramaṇḍalāyanamaḥ
padmāyanamaḥ yathordhvarecakenanītaṃ tathaivordhvapūrakenabrahmarandhrabhrumadhyatālu
kaṇṭhakrameṇahṛtpadmeātmānaṃvinyasya oṃjuṃsaḥtanvamamṛtīkarominamaḥ
itidvādaśāntacidbindusrutāmṛtadhārābhirāplāvyasaṃjīvitaṃ oṃmā
yādikṣityantaikatriṃśattattvarūpāyaśuddhadehāyanamaḥ itiśuddhadehamutpannaṃ
bhāvayet|| tataḥbrahmaṇenamaḥ vāstupuruṣāyanamaḥ haṃmūrtayenamaḥ||

<pṛ0 3ba> tatodvārārcākalaśeṣu prabhāmaṇḍalāyanamaḥ vṛṣabhāyanamaḥ bhṛṅgeśāyana
maḥ kumārāyanamaḥ ambikāyainamaḥ itipadmapūjā| athadvārapūjā||
laṃindrāyavajrahastāyanamaḥ (10) tataḥpūrvādikrameṇadigmātṛpūjā||
svavāmenandinenamaḥ svadakṣemahākālāyanamaḥ svavāyogaṇeśapūjā| sva
naiṛtesūryapūjā madhyekumārapūjā svadakṣegrahapūjā tatonyāsaṃ oṃhrāṃhṛ(0)
hrīṃśira(0) hūṃśikhaḥhraiṃkava(0) hrauṃnetrā(0)hraḥastrā(0)| oṃoṃātmatatvāyanamaḥ
hṛdi oṃjuṃvidyātatvāyanamaḥ kaṇṭhe oṃsaḥśivatatvāyanamaḥ śirasi
tatonavatatvanyāsaḥ oṃśivatatvāyanamaḥ karandhre sadāśivatatvāyanamaḥ
lalāṭe īśvaratatvāyanamaḥ bhrumadhye vidyātatvāyanamaḥ tāluni oṃmā

<pṛ0 4a> yātatvāyanamaḥ kaṇṭhe kālatatvāyanamaḥ hṛdi oṃniyatitatvāyanamaḥ nā
bhau oṃpuruṣatatvāyanamaḥ meḍhre oṃprakṛtitatvāyanamaḥ pādayoḥ|| atha
dīkṣitaviṣaye aghoraṃ aghorīśvarī niṣkalaṃamṛtīśvaraṃamṛtalakṣmī iti
dīkṣitaviṣayenyāsaṃ|| itimantreṇaṣaḍaṅganyāsaṃkuryāt tatarastrādauvipa
retanyāsaḥ| oṃhaḥanantabalaśaktiastrāyaphaṭnamaḥ oṃhauṃaluptaśakti
netrebhyovauṣaṭnamaḥ oṃhaiṃsvatantrāyakavacāyahuṃnamaḥ oṃhūṃanādibodhi
śikhāyaivaṣaṭnamaḥ oṃhīṃtṛptiśirasesvāhānamaḥ oṃhāṃsarvajñatvāhṛda
yāyanamaḥ oṃguṃbahurūpabhairavāyavauṣaṭ guṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ guṃśira(0) guṃ
śikhā(0) guṃkavaca(0) guṃnetre(0) guṃastrāya|| oṃhrīmāyādevyainamaḥ hāṃṣaḍa
ṅgaḥ

<pṛ0 4ba> tataḥśivahastaṃkuryāt vaktrapañcakasaṃyuktaḥśivenādiṣṭhitaḥśivaḥ pāśa
cchedakarohyeṣaḥśivahastaḥprakīrtitaḥ somamaṇḍalāyanamaḥ vāmakaresūrya
maṇḍalāyanamaḥ dakṣiṇakare śivāmbhasāstrāmbhasākaratalamabhyukṣyāva
guṇṭhya devasyaṣaḍaṅgaṃvidhāyasampūjya kṣaṃyaṃraṃvaṃlaṃtilakapañcakaṃkṛtvā
kṣaṃ īśānavaktrāyanamaḥ pū(0)yaṃtatpuruṣavaktrāyanamaḥ da(0) raṃaghoravaktrāyanamaḥ
