ṅgaṃsavaktraṃ dehaprāṇaśuddhiṃvidhāya mṛddhadhittaukaraukṛtvā astrenaprokṣitau
kavacenāvaguṇṭhitau amṛtīśvaramudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya'mṛtenāplāvayet
tatkaramadhyamāṅguṣṭhābhyāmitarakarārpitakusumairāsanaṃṣaḍaṅgaṃvidhāya

<pṛ0 5a> sāṅgaṃsavaktraṃmūlaṃsampūjya vāmahastaṃdakṣihasteanyonyamarpayet dakṣiṇa
hastaṃhṛdi vāmahastaṃśirasinyaset itiśivahastavidhiḥ|| tataḥpañca
gavyavidhiḥ| śālicūrṇenanavakoṣṭhaṃkṛtvā tanmadhyepātrāṇisaviṣṭarāṇi
saṃsthāpya gomayaṃtuhṛdāpaścegomūtraṃśirasottare dadhiprācyāṃśikhāyāṃtu
madhyekṣīraṃtuvartmanā dakṣiṇeghṛtamastreṇanetrenaiśekuśodakam krameṇa
mūlasarvenamīlayitvāśivaṃyajet oṃhaḥphaṭpātrāṇiśodhayāmi
phaṭ itisaptavāramabhimantritaṃ taṃśivāmbhasāprokṣitaṃ haiṃpātrāṇi
