ṇīśānāntaṃpūjayet navatattvapūjā| śivatattvāyanamaḥ madhye sadā

<pṛ0 5ba> śivatatvāyanamaḥ pūrve īśvaratatvāyanamaḥ agre vidyātatvāyanamaḥ dakṣe
