mṛtākhyainamaḥ paścime ratnodayāyanamaḥ uttare|| gomayaṃtuhṛdāpaśce
oṃhāṃhṛda(0)ekavāramuccārya laṃsadyojātamūrtayenamaḥ gomayaṃsarvamaṅgu
